text:
@275692 1 form of payment is required to be on your account at all times. 

There's no need to delete your payment methods because all information will be removed once the account is deleted. 
Follow these steps to delete your account: https://t.co/T9QCqACqox.

@718640 As stated in the email, this will only be up to 48 hours while we review the information and feedback.
You will receive a message advising you when your account has been reactivated. 

Please keep an eye out for our next email.

@428272 Ratings on the Uber platform are the same across the globe. For more info, see these pages: 

https://t.co/SDxKv6MoxZ

https://t.co/kWptmPiR2h
